{%- comment -%}
  Quote request for an unpriced product.

  A slice of this catalogue is published at ₪0. Offering "add to cart" there
  hands the item over for free, so the buy button is replaced with a real
  enquiry: the built-in contact form (no app needed), plus one-tap phone and
  WhatsApp with the product and SKU already filled in.

  Usage: {% render 'request-price', product: product, variant: variant %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign target = variant | default: product.selected_or_first_available_variant
  assign form_id = 'RequestPrice-' | append: product.id

  assign tel_href = settings.store_phone | remove: '-' | remove: ' ' | remove: '(' | remove: ')'

  assign wa_href = ''
  if settings.store_whatsapp != blank
    assign wa_scheme = settings.store_whatsapp | slice: 0, 4
    if wa_scheme == 'http'
      assign wa_href = settings.store_whatsapp
    else
      assign wa_digits = settings.store_whatsapp | remove: '+' | remove: '-' | remove: ' '
      assign wa_href = 'https://wa.me/' | append: wa_digits
    endif
  endif
-%}

<div class="request-price">
  <div class="request-price__head">
    {% render 'icon', name: 'tag', size: 20 %}
    <div>
      <p class="request-price__title">{{ 'products.price.call_for_price' | t }}</p>
      <p class="text-meta">
        המחיר של הפריט הזה נקבע לפי כמות ודגם. השאירו טלפון או אימייל ונחזור אליכם
        עם הצעת מחיר - או פשוט התקשרו, ונענה מיד.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="request-price__actions">
    {%- if settings.store_phone != blank -%}
      <a class="btn btn--full" href="tel:{{ tel_href }}">
        {% render 'icon', name: 'phone', size: 18 %}
        <span dir="ltr">{{ settings.store_phone }}</span>
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if wa_href != blank -%}
      <a class="btn btn--outline btn--full" href="{{ wa_href }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        {% render 'icon', name: 'whatsapp', size: 18 %}
        <span>שאלו בוואטסאפ</span>
      </a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    The form is captured so its posted/error state can be read from OUTSIDE the
    disclosure. It used to live entirely inside a <details> with no `open`
    attribute, and the confirmation was the form body's first child — so
    Shopify's post-redirect returned the shopper to a page that looked exactly as
    it had before they filled anything in. People concluded the form was broken
    and submitted again, filling the shop inbox with duplicate quote requests.

    The acknowledgement is hoisted out of the disclosure entirely, and the
    disclosure only reopens when the submit failed, so the shopper lands on the
    errors. Note that form.posted_successfully? on a {% form 'contact' %} is
    page-scoped rather than per-form-id, and back-in-stock.liquid opens a second
    contact form on the same product page whenever the variant is sold out — so
    the wording stays generic enough to be true for either.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign quote_posted = false -%}
  {%- assign quote_failed = false -%}
  {%- capture quote_form -%}
    {%- form 'contact', id: form_id, class: 'request-price__form' -%}
      {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
        {%- assign quote_posted = true -%}
      {%- else -%}
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          {%- assign quote_failed = true -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if form.errors -%}
          <div class="errors" role="alert" tabindex="-1">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>
        {%- endif -%}

        <input type="hidden" name="contact[נושא]" value="בקשת הצעת מחיר">
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[מוצר]" value="{{ product.title | escape }}">
        {%- if target.title != 'Default Title' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[וריאנט]" value="{{ target.title | escape }}">
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if target.sku != blank -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[מקט]" value="{{ target.sku | escape }}">
        {%- endif -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[קישור]" value="{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}">

        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-name">שם</label>
          <input id="{{ form_id }}-name" class="field__input" type="text" name="contact[שם]" value="{{ form.name | default: customer.name }}" autocomplete="name" required>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-email">אימייל</label>
          <input id="{{ form_id }}-email" class="field__input" type="email" name="contact[email]" value="{{ form.email | default: customer.email }}" autocomplete="email" required>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-phone">טלפון</label>
          <input id="{{ form_id }}-phone" class="field__input" type="tel" name="contact[טלפון]" value="{{ form.phone | default: customer.phone }}" dir="ltr" autocomplete="tel">
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label class="field__label" for="{{ form_id }}-qty">כמות נדרשת</label>
          <input id="{{ form_id }}-qty" class="field__input" type="text" name="contact[כמות]" dir="ltr" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="1">
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn--secondary btn--full">
          {% render 'icon', name: 'mail', size: 17 %}
          שליחת הבקשה
        </button>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endform -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- if quote_posted -%}
    <p class="form__success" role="status">
      {% render 'icon', name: 'check-circle', size: 18 %}
      קיבלנו את הבקשה - נחזור אליכם בהקדם.
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}

  <details class="request-price__form-wrap" {% if quote_failed %}open{% endif %}>
    <summary class="request-price__toggle">
      <span>או שלחו בקשה להצעת מחיר</span>
      {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down', size: 18, class: 'icon-chevron' %}
    </summary>
    {{ quote_form }}
  </details>
</div>
